<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site.css">
    
    <title>Owen Espitia'S Portfolio</title>
</head>
<body class="not-homepage">
        <%- include("partials/header.ejs") %>
    <main id = "main-content" role="main">
        <div class = "container">
            <section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
                <h2 id = "about-heading">Past and Current Projects</h2>
                <div class="about-content">
                    <div class="about-text">
                        <p>This page is for learning about my past projects to get a feel of what I'm comfortable with.</p>
                        
                    </div>

                    <aside class="interests" aria-labelledby="interests-heading">
                        <h3 id = "interests-heading" style="font-style: italic;">"Every Champion was once a contender who refused to give up" -Rocky Balboa</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>
                                <details>
                                    <summary>Basic Calculator</summary>
                                    <p>Built for Intro to Computer Science. This was one of the first real projects I completed; although not that impressive, I still consider it as a milestone in my career</p>
                                </details>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <details>
                                    <summary>Zombie Generator</summary>
                                    <p>Built for Object Oriented Programming. This project was fun and one of the first projects I had a lot of fun making. I challenged me at the time and also demonstrated a lot of good OOP principles</p>
                                </details>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <details>
                                    <summary>Zomba Game</summary>
                                    <p>Built as a Final for Object Oriented Programming. This was taking the zombie generator further and turning it into a RTS game. This was a very fun project and I still take a little pride in it.</p>
                                </details>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <details>
                                    <summary>File Roulette</summary>
                                    <p>Built for Project Managment. This was a C# program that had a slot machine that took files from your computer as payment. If you lost it would encrpyt the files and store them in local memory until you 'won' them back. First real team project, it was awesome!</p>
                                </details>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <details>
                                    <summary>Wikipedia in MongoDB</summary>
                                    <p>I built this project for Persistance Projects. The goal was tackling working with huge amounts of data specifically desgined to be more than your computer could handle. Ultimately, me and my team were able to write all of Wikipedia's pages into a Mongo database and query it.</p>
                                </details>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <details>
                                    <summary>Trigonometry Calculator</summary>
                                    <p>This was more of a passion project of mine, the gaol was to make a comprehensive and visual calculator for trigonometry. The calculator offers graphs of the unit circle and standard trig functions. This project is in the making.</p>
                                </details>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                        <p style="font-style: italic; font-weight:200; font-size: smaller;">*This is just a small list of my past and current projects</p>
                    </aside>
                </div>

            </section>
        </div>

    </main>
    <%- include("partials/footer.ejs") %>
</body>
</html>